431
00:34:10,280 --> 00:34:14,480
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: at naglilinis po kami. Kasi meron na po moving forward ng biometrics

432
00:34:14,480 --> 00:34:18,600
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: para matiyak na yung pinagkakakilanlan ng ating pasyente ay talagang

433
00:34:18,600 --> 00:34:20,320
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: siya 'yun bago ma-enroll

434
00:34:20,320 --> 00:34:22,560
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: dito sa YAKAP. Meron po tayong

435
00:34:22,560 --> 00:34:24,660
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: 40,000 cancer patients

436
00:34:24,660 --> 00:34:26,700
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: na nakatanggap sa Cancer Assistance Fund.

437
00:34:27,370 --> 00:34:33,190
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Meron po tayong 2,000 health infrastructure projects na na-kompleto mula 2023 hanggang 2025.

438
00:34:33,970 --> 00:34:39,070
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Meron po tayong higit limang, almost 5,000 medical equipment procured and delivered

439
00:34:39,070 --> 00:34:45,670
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: and nearly 500 medical transport vehicles provided for emergency response and patient referral.

440
00:34:45,930 --> 00:34:49,950
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Actually, ito pong ambulansya, meron na rin po tayong coverage of Hill Health.

441
00:34:50,370 --> 00:34:53,330
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pati ito po yung mga registered or licensed ambulance.

442
00:34:53,330 --> 00:34:57,590
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pinag-aaralan po kung pwede na rin maka-cover yung patient transport vehicles

443
00:34:57,590 --> 00:35:02,250
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: dahil yun naman po yung pinakamalimit na nagagamit sa pagtatransfer po ng ating pasyente.

444
00:35:02,990 --> 00:35:03,730
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Next slide po.

445
00:35:04,970 --> 00:35:10,330
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So dito naman po sa ating mga hospital, gaya na nasabi ko po sa inyo kanina,

446
00:35:10,470 --> 00:35:17,390
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: 102.9 billion of the budget is going to the 71 DOH regional hospital

