00:37:54,770 --> 00:37:59,010
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: mas madali po nating makukuha live yung ating data.

483
00:38:01,010 --> 00:38:06,690
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang huli po nating pillar ay yung strong institution and health workforce.

484
00:38:06,690 --> 00:38:11,730
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So tuloy pa rin po yung ating national health workforce support system.

485
00:38:11,730 --> 00:38:17,730
