489
00:38:30,850 --> 00:38:35,250
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At meron din po tayong 1.2 billion for supply chain management.

490
00:38:35,250 --> 00:38:41,250
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So ang tinitingnan nga po namin ay mas paigtingin pa itong ating IT system ng supply chain

