00:38:47,090 --> 00:38:52,370
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At ma-predict po natin yung ating turnaround time ng delivery ng ating mga gamot.

493
00:38:52,370 --> 00:38:56,770
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So ito po ay ang kabuan po. Next slide po.

494
00:38:56,770 --> 00:39:04,690
