714
00:50:11,240 --> 00:50:17,460
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Sa datos po namin, ito po yung Super Health Centers.

715
00:50:17,460 --> 00:50:18,460
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Sa datos po namin, ito po yung Super Health Centers.

716
00:50:18,460 --> 00:50:19,460
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Sa dados po namin, ito po yung Super Health Centers.

717
00:50:19,460 --> 00:50:24,460
