04:44:12,060 --> 04:44:16,660
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: And so precisely why moving forward, we're already looking at how to,

3694
04:44:16,840 --> 04:44:20,440
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: create a rules-based IMA-IFIP procedure po.

3695
04:44:21,160 --> 04:44:24,480
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasi po, I cannot speak for the past decisions.

3696
04:44:24,780 --> 04:44:31,280
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: That has been the issue during, hindi lang ngayon, last year, the year before that.

3697
04:44:32,420 --> 04:44:35,240
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And every time, it consistently happens.

3698
04:44:35,240 --> 04:44:46,240
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: I'm raising this, not for myself, but for the countless of poor patients that are deprived of this health,

3699
04:44:46,240 --> 04:44:47,240
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: of this aid.

3700
04:44:47,240 --> 04:44:54,230
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Di ba parang mali?

3701
04:44:54,230 --> 04:44:56,230
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So what will we do about it?

3702
04:44:56,230 --> 04:44:58,230
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Sabihin na lang natin sa pasyente, pasensya na.

3703
04:45:02,160 --> 04:45:09,020
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Madam Chair, kaya po talagang sinistrengtha namin yung EMI-FIP para nga po directly doon na po mag-apply yung pasyente.

3704
04:45:09,780 --> 04:45:12,660
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At ngayon po, nag-start lang po tayo ngayong August.

3705
04:45:13,760 --> 04:45:17,820
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Nag-start po tayo muna with the DOH hospitals and then the LGU.

3706
04:45:18,320 --> 04:45:23,660
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: And hopefully, we will expand to include SUCs, GOCCs, and private hospitals po.

3707
04:45:24,540 --> 04:45:27,160
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, give us just...

3708
04:45:27,160 --> 04:45:28,300
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Meron na pong GOCC.

3709
04:45:28,300 --> 04:45:31,800
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yung private hospital po ang nag-mumua pa po.

3710
04:45:32,260 --> 04:45:35,540
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Parang kunyari sa distrito ko, pitumbuhan na yung mga pasyente.

3711
04:45:35,880 --> 04:45:40,760
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Tinutulungan na nga ng opisina namin mag-apply na lang ng EMI-FIP.

3712
04:45:40,860 --> 04:45:46,460
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: But for the past seven months, hindi sila maka-avail.

3713
04:45:46,600 --> 04:45:52,080
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Bakit? What is so wrong with my constituents in the 4th District that they cannot be given help?

3714
04:45:52,200 --> 04:45:55,480
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And laki-laki nang in-allocate for this particular service.

3715
04:45:59,140 --> 04:46:01,100
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kailangan mag-makawa ako sa ibang Congress.

3716
04:46:01,180 --> 04:46:07,660
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: At man, para bigyan naman nilang pansin yung mga may hirap na pasyente doon sa distrito ko.

3717
04:46:14,210 --> 04:46:16,870
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Well, I will proceed further to my other questions.

3718
04:46:19,200 --> 04:46:24,940
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Now, during the son of the President, he mentioned about the zero-balance billing.

3719
04:46:25,760 --> 04:46:30,160
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And with the current budget given to the Department of Health,

3720
04:46:31,060 --> 04:46:34,140
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: how do we plan to achieve this zero-balance billing?

3721
04:46:34,140 --> 04:46:36,140
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kukunin ba natin sa PhilHealth lahat?

3722
04:46:36,380 --> 04:46:38,140
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Or is it also the...

3723
04:46:38,480 --> 04:46:44,680
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: What other forces or funds will we use to address this zero-balance billing bill?

3724
04:46:44,740 --> 04:46:45,780
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: That's a tall promise.

3725
04:46:48,880 --> 04:46:59,260
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: The MOOE and the PS allocation of that GAA for DOH Hospital should cover its fixed cost.

3726
04:46:59,260 --> 04:47:07,220
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Meaning, yung pumpasweldo at saka all other fixed costs like

3727
04:47:07,220 --> 04:47:09,260
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: mga...

3728
04:47:09,920 --> 04:47:11,260
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: kuryente, etc.

3729
04:47:11,260 --> 04:47:16,060
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang ano nalang po namin talaga is how we will compute the variable cost,

3730
04:47:16,060 --> 04:47:20,760
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: which is the actual consumable related to the dispensation of care,

3731
04:47:20,760 --> 04:47:25,420
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: na makover po ng PhilHealth at saka po ng next level.

3732
04:47:25,420 --> 04:47:33,980
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang ma-EFI po is we envision na should be for outliers, yung talagang malalaki pong mga kaso na hindi po sapat yung PhilHealth.

3733
04:47:33,980 --> 04:47:35,980
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: And that is the way it should be.

3734
04:47:35,980 --> 04:47:39,460
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: First payer po ang PhilHealth, then second payer po ang ma-EFI po.

3735
04:47:39,460 --> 04:47:45,000
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Ang problema kasi, Secretary, is when the zero-balance billing was promised,

3736
04:47:45,720 --> 04:47:52,600
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: of course, patients expected na pagpumunta nga sila sa hospital, wala silang babayaran.

3737
04:47:52,600 --> 04:48:02,340
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: But we all know that that's close to impossible to achieve unless nga napakalaki nung alokasyon na makukuha ng DOH.

3738
04:48:03,000 --> 04:48:08,600
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So, when it comes to the zero-balance billing, ano lang talaga yung makukover para malalaman,

3739
04:48:09,460 --> 04:48:16,700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: mga pumunta sa hospital at hindi sila nagtataka kung bakit pag-alis nila ng hospital mayroong material ba rin silang binabayaran

3740
04:48:16,700 --> 04:48:18,800
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: O merong kailangan bayaran?

3741
04:48:18,800 --> 04:48:33,020
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Madam Chair, our rule po talaga dapat pag charity or basic accommodation dapat walang bayaran.

3742
04:48:33,020 --> 04:48:34,820
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So yun po yung titingnan natin.

3743
04:48:34,820 --> 04:48:41,680
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Gagawan po talaga ng very strict rules na masunod po.

3744
04:48:41,680 --> 04:48:45,470
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Ano-ano ho yung, Secretary?

3745
04:48:45,470 --> 04:48:47,030
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ah,

3746
04:48:47,030 --> 04:48:57,390
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Doon po sa basic accommodation, ang rule po naman na nakasaad doon sa UHC law ay dapat po no balance bill. Wala pong out-of-pocket na ilalabas.

3747
04:48:57,890 --> 04:49:07,490
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: But on the ground, that's not what's happening. In fact, if that is what is happening, kahit yung maipip, hindi na kailangan huminyi yung mga pasyente.

3748
04:49:07,490 --> 04:49:23,540
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So yun nga po, ang tinitingnan namin, yung mga outliers na pwede maari pong falling between the cracks, na yun nga po dapat ang nako-cover naman ngayon ng second liner, which is the maipip.

3749
04:49:23,860 --> 04:49:35,560
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pero yung routine po, na meron na tayong Z-BEN, meron po tayong ACR, na 70% na po yung coverage ng ating total SOA, dapat po wala nang inilalabas ang ating mga pasyente.

3750
04:49:35,720 --> 04:49:37,200
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At yun po ay momonitor po natin.

3751
04:49:37,200 --> 04:49:39,040
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Now, Madam Chair, just...

3752
04:49:39,060 --> 04:49:40,660
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Last two short questions.

3753
04:49:41,080 --> 04:49:46,360
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: The YACAP program, YACAP Gamote, is a very good program initiated by PhilHealth.

3754
04:49:46,500 --> 04:49:55,540
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: But I believe there should be guidelines established dahil ito eh, we have noticed that this is being abused by some of the providers.

3755
04:49:55,720 --> 04:49:57,300
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Paano nyo pinipili yung providers?

3756
04:49:58,280 --> 04:50:00,240
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: How is it abused? Ito yung sinasabi ko.

3757
04:50:00,440 --> 04:50:06,360
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: There are now numerous mga medical missions being conducted in the barangay level.

3758
04:50:06,640 --> 04:50:08,860
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kung saan nagpaparehistro sila.

3759
04:50:08,860 --> 04:50:10,500
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Anong mga pasyenteng dumadating?

3760
04:50:10,640 --> 04:50:20,540
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Yung mga pasyente, not knowing na pagka niregister ka, dun sa particular medical mission na yun,

3761
04:50:20,800 --> 04:50:25,920
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: kung sino pala yung nag-initiate ng medical mission, registered ka na ng YACAP sa kanya,

3762
04:50:26,080 --> 04:50:31,060
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: e minsan yung mga providers na yan would just go to your 2-1 barangay.

3763
04:50:31,480 --> 04:50:37,060
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And hindi naman sila, kunyari sa akin, hindi naman sila Quezon City-based or whatever city-based.

3764
04:50:37,060 --> 04:50:38,060
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Ngayon, hindi na alam nung...

3765
04:50:38,860 --> 04:50:41,440
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kung saan pupuntahan yung provider.

3766
04:50:41,860 --> 04:50:47,060
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: E diba meron, I think, medicine na dapat ibibigay dun sa registered na pasyente.

3767
04:50:49,880 --> 04:50:51,060
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Dr. Beverly?

3768
04:50:52,060 --> 04:50:53,460
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Thank you, Madam Chair.

3769
04:50:55,100 --> 04:51:02,500
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: We understand all the challenges that are on the ground currently for YACAP program.

3770
04:51:03,260 --> 04:51:07,780
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: We do have a 2.0 version of YACAP.

3771
04:51:07,780 --> 04:51:08,780
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: So we're just...

3772
04:51:08,860 --> 04:51:15,360
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Clearing out, doing final consultations with our stakeholders, both the providers as well as patient groups.

3773
04:51:15,940 --> 04:51:22,060
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: But specifically, I think the enhancements will really focus on the consent, right?

3774
04:51:22,060 --> 04:51:25,540
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Kasi ngayon, hindi talaga nila alam na na-empanel na sila.

3775
04:51:26,120 --> 04:51:30,200
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: A check utility, meaning ensuring that that's actually really a live person.

3776
04:51:31,060 --> 04:51:34,260
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Then, ensuring that they're actually verified.

3777
04:51:34,740 --> 04:51:38,060
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: So, meron din pong magkakaroon ng changes in terms of the...

3778
04:51:38,860 --> 04:51:40,060
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: incentives.

3779
04:51:40,480 --> 04:51:44,020
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: Kasi ngayon po, diba, isang malaking bagsak yung FPE.

3780
04:51:44,580 --> 04:51:49,460
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: So, we end up, actually, some providers just do the FPE only, right?

3781
04:51:49,540 --> 04:51:51,620
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: And not proceed with the rest of the care.

3782
04:51:52,000 --> 04:52:02,620
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: So, there will be adjustments on that as well as on the performance-based financing or incentives that come with the YACAP program.

3783
04:52:02,620 --> 04:52:04,620
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: So, medyo comprehensive po siya.

3784
04:52:05,400 --> 04:52:07,780
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: May IT system changes din.

3785
04:52:08,300 --> 04:52:08,740
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: But that's...

3786
04:52:08,860 --> 04:52:11,800
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: That should be rolled out towards end of the year and early next year.

3787
04:52:11,960 --> 04:52:14,880
PhilHealth President and CEO Dr. Beverly Lorraine Ho: But we're trying to address the issues that you mentioned po.

3788
04:52:16,180 --> 04:52:20,880
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Madam Chair Doc, well, can you provide us with a list of those accredited?

3789
04:52:20,880 --> 04:52:26,260
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kasi, sayang, it's such a good program na sana mapakinabangan ng tao at hindi ng mga provider.

3790
04:52:26,420 --> 04:52:33,380
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Because we have received numerous complaints na meron nagbaro ba, allegedly, free medical mission raw.

3791
04:52:33,660 --> 04:52:38,840
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Tapos nun, yung mga ibang pasyente na pupunta, magpa-fasting pa sila.

3792
04:52:38,860 --> 04:52:41,760
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Para ng 24 hours para dun sa blood chem nila.

3793
04:52:41,920 --> 04:52:45,520
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Tapos pagdating nila dun, biglang papawiin sila.

3794
04:52:45,640 --> 04:52:53,860
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kasi, apparently, pag tinignan sa system, registered sila sa ibang provider.

3795
04:52:54,860 --> 04:52:57,540
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Now sila, sasabihin lang, hindi sila registered.

3796
04:52:57,720 --> 04:53:06,200
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kasi, hindi naman nila alam na ni-register pala sila nung nag-avail sila nung allegedly free medical mission.

3797
04:53:06,420 --> 04:53:08,000
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So, this is now being abused.

3798
04:53:08,000 --> 04:53:08,700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Ang problema,

3799
04:53:08,860 --> 04:53:14,160
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: yung gamot, baka yung gamot, sinasabi, binibigay sa pasyente, natatanggap nila.

3800
04:53:14,300 --> 04:53:18,300
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Hindi naman pala binibigay nung provider.

3801
04:53:18,520 --> 04:53:22,220
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Pero sinisingil yung gobyerno with regards to this.

3802
04:53:22,980 --> 04:53:23,100
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Diba?

3803
04:53:23,460 --> 04:53:27,100
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So, I hope you could, we could correct this immediately.

3804
04:53:27,340 --> 04:53:32,620
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And if you could furnish us with the provider so that we could also report sa inyo.

3805
04:53:32,620 --> 04:53:38,660
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And lastly, I erased this before na.

3806
04:53:38,860 --> 04:53:43,960
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: But there are vaccines which are, alam mo, seasonal yung need.

3807
04:53:44,940 --> 04:53:49,480
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: I remember nung flu season, I requested for flu vaccines.

3808
04:53:49,660 --> 04:53:51,340
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: This was not during your time.

3809
04:53:51,440 --> 04:53:54,220
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: It was during the time of Secretary Ted Erbosa.

3810
04:53:54,980 --> 04:53:58,320
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Actually, ang unang hiningi ko, inyong moko-call vaccine.

3811
04:53:58,520 --> 04:53:59,420
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Sabi niya, meron daw.

3812
04:53:59,940 --> 04:54:03,120
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Pero nung binigay ko na yung sulat ay, sabi niya, wala pala.

3813
04:54:03,240 --> 04:54:04,700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Flu vaccine na lang meron.

3814
04:54:04,700 --> 04:54:07,700
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So, sabi ko, okay lang yung flu vaccine para sa mga seniors.

3815
04:54:08,860 --> 04:54:11,000
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: When we requested, sabi niya, wala.

3816
04:54:11,180 --> 04:54:16,220
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Then, apparently, there was no bidding for moko-call and flu vaccine.

3817
04:54:16,320 --> 04:54:20,600
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: But that was several months ago already.

3818
04:54:21,000 --> 04:54:21,980
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Patapos na yung taon.

3819
04:54:22,200 --> 04:54:26,040
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So, what happened?

3820
04:54:33,110 --> 04:54:39,510
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Madam Chair, yun nga po yung na-mention namin na the BAC already recommended the award.

3821
04:54:39,510 --> 04:54:43,510
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At kami po ay on track to procure at most probably by...

3822
04:54:45,190 --> 04:54:49,570
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: October po or early November po ay meron na po tayong ma-i-de-distribute.

3823
04:54:50,370 --> 04:54:51,190
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Check what happened.

3824
04:54:51,630 --> 04:54:56,370
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Yung question ko, why was there a belated award?

3825
04:54:57,050 --> 04:54:58,850
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Award should be timely.

3826
04:54:59,050 --> 04:55:02,230
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Parang yung problema sa age prep rin natin yan.

3827
04:55:02,350 --> 04:55:02,790
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Diba, minsan?

3828
04:55:02,910 --> 04:55:06,450
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kaya hindi yung accomplishment rate.

3829
04:55:06,550 --> 04:55:07,370
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kaya mababa rin.

3830
04:55:07,490 --> 04:55:08,270
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Hindi on target.

3831
04:55:08,270 --> 04:55:12,170
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Because either nahuhuli yung pagtapos, nahuhuli yung award.

3832
04:55:12,310 --> 04:55:14,210
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: But now, what happened in this particular instance?

3833
04:55:14,450 --> 04:55:15,070
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So, that...

3834
04:55:15,190 --> 04:55:15,750
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: We just know.

3835
04:55:17,250 --> 04:55:20,930
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pwede pong tawagin natin si Yusek Lel sa kilabon po.

3836
04:55:21,010 --> 04:55:24,390
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Siya po yung aming Yusek for procurement po.

3837
04:55:25,590 --> 04:55:25,990
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Thank you.

3838
04:55:26,130 --> 04:55:28,230
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Cong Bong, that's the last question and then we'll...

3839
04:55:28,230 --> 04:55:28,870
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Yes, Madam Chair.

3840
04:55:28,990 --> 04:55:29,650
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Thank you very much.

3841
04:55:30,790 --> 04:55:31,410
DOH Undersecretary Christian Lel M. Saquilabon: Yes, sir.

3842
04:55:31,610 --> 04:55:31,950
DOH Undersecretary Christian Lel M. Saquilabon: Yes, sir.

3843
04:55:32,390 --> 04:55:34,190
DOH Undersecretary Christian Lel M. Saquilabon: There are confluence of factors.

3844
04:55:34,190 --> 04:55:40,650
DOH Undersecretary Christian Lel M. Saquilabon: Number one, there was a protest by one of the disqualified bidders.

3845
04:55:40,850 --> 04:55:45,010
DOH Undersecretary Christian Lel M. Saquilabon: And then, it was coincided with the change in management.

3846
04:55:45,190 --> 04:55:51,190
DOH Undersecretary Christian Lel M. Saquilabon: So, it was endorsed to the predecessor of the acting secretary right now,

3847
04:55:51,450 --> 04:55:52,150
DOH Undersecretary Christian Lel M. Saquilabon: Secretary Puhalte.

3848
04:55:52,330 --> 04:55:58,910
DOH Undersecretary Christian Lel M. Saquilabon: And then, of course, he only remained with the DOH for, I think, two weeks.

3849
04:55:59,590 --> 04:56:04,430
DOH Undersecretary Christian Lel M. Saquilabon: So, and he was not able to resolve it because he's supposed to review the protest.

3850
04:56:04,670 --> 04:56:10,170
DOH Undersecretary Christian Lel M. Saquilabon: And then, acting Secretary Mercado already resolved the protest.

3851
04:56:10,170 --> 04:56:13,170
DOH Undersecretary Christian Lel M. Saquilabon: And we already...

3852
04:56:13,170 --> 04:56:20,470
DOH Undersecretary Christian Lel M. Saquilabon: For the 2026, there's already a noticeable word also with 2025, sir.

3853
04:56:20,610 --> 04:56:22,890
DOH Undersecretary Christian Lel M. Saquilabon: That is the one that has the protest, sir.

3854
04:56:23,290 --> 04:56:24,810
DOH Undersecretary Christian Lel M. Saquilabon: So, it was highly contentious.

3855
04:56:25,250 --> 04:56:29,250
DOH Undersecretary Christian Lel M. Saquilabon: But we already resolved, sir, that particular issue, sir.

3856
04:56:30,210 --> 04:56:31,270
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Now, two reasons.

3857
04:56:31,410 --> 04:56:32,170
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: You gave two reasons.

3858
04:56:32,370 --> 04:56:35,230
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Because of the protest, because of change in management.

3859
04:56:35,510 --> 04:56:40,030
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Actually, yung protest, it depends on anong reason yung protest.

3860
04:56:40,170 --> 04:56:43,150
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Because during a bidding process, napakadaling magdating.

3861
04:56:43,290 --> 04:56:44,910
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: It is qualified ng bidder.

3862
04:56:45,270 --> 04:56:46,970
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kaya nagkakaroon ng protesta eh.

3863
04:56:47,850 --> 04:56:49,970
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: But I would not dwell on that.

3864
04:56:50,110 --> 04:56:52,250
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kasi ang importante lang sa akin yung mga gamot.

3865
04:56:52,410 --> 04:56:55,650
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: But the thing is, we all know.

3866
04:56:57,050 --> 04:56:59,190
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Yung change in management should not be a cause.

3867
04:56:59,430 --> 04:57:03,090
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Because hindi naman buong DOH ang pinapalitan.

3868
04:57:03,090 --> 04:57:06,950
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So, ibig mong sabihin, every time that there is a change in the secretary,

3869
04:57:07,410 --> 04:57:09,610
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: all the procurement process will stop?

3870
04:57:10,250 --> 04:57:12,330
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Ganun ba yung kalakaran sa DOH?

3871
04:57:13,170 --> 04:57:13,530
DOH Undersecretary Christian Lel M. Saquilabon: No, sir.

3872
04:57:13,790 --> 04:57:19,470
DOH Undersecretary Christian Lel M. Saquilabon: But, of course, the incoming secretary would have to do his due diligence regarding the matter.

3873
04:57:19,870 --> 04:57:25,210
DOH Undersecretary Christian Lel M. Saquilabon: He has his own legal team to review the recommendations of the COVAX, sir.

3874
04:57:25,730 --> 04:57:27,730
DOH Undersecretary Christian Lel M. Saquilabon: So, that's it, sir.

3875
04:57:28,250 --> 04:57:35,090
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So, to the detriment of the beneficiaries, the patients, the Filipino people who would need those vaccines?

3876
04:57:36,030 --> 04:57:37,090
DOH Undersecretary Christian Lel M. Saquilabon: Certainly not, sir.

3877
04:57:37,170 --> 04:57:41,730
DOH Undersecretary Christian Lel M. Saquilabon: But we, on our side, the procurement side and the legal service, we provide briefers.

3878
04:57:41,730 --> 04:57:47,770
DOH Undersecretary Christian Lel M. Saquilabon: But, just the same, there has to be an independent evaluation by the Secretary of Health

3879
04:57:47,770 --> 04:57:51,350
DOH Undersecretary Christian Lel M. Saquilabon: in whether he agrees with the recommendation of the COVAX, sir.

3880
04:57:51,390 --> 04:57:58,250
DOH Undersecretary Christian Lel M. Saquilabon: But, certainly, sir, moving forward, we'll abbreviate the process regarding procurement, sir.

3881
04:57:58,790 --> 04:58:05,610
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: The reason why there is a government structure, parang whether private yan o government office yan,

3882
04:58:05,690 --> 04:58:06,870
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: that's why there's a structure.

3883
04:58:06,870 --> 04:58:11,030
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: So that, in case na may mawala, may mag-resign, may natanggal,

3884
04:58:11,730 --> 04:58:15,310
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: the company or the government would still be able to move.

3885
04:58:16,230 --> 04:58:21,490
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kasi, kagaya, if I rely on yung sinabi mo as a basis, kaya hindi nag-procure,

3886
04:58:22,010 --> 04:58:23,650
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: then babalik ako, isipin mo.

3887
04:58:24,230 --> 04:58:29,150
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: That should have been given at the start of the year.

3888
04:58:29,370 --> 04:58:30,710
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Patapos na yung taon.

3889
04:58:30,910 --> 04:58:32,070
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: It's already September.

3890
04:58:32,550 --> 04:58:35,990
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: By the time magkaroon ng bidding kayo at magkaroon ng award,

3891
04:58:35,990 --> 04:58:40,830
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: baka nobyembre na yan, iro-roll out nyo pa sa mga regions yan.

3892
04:58:41,730 --> 04:58:44,850
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Kaya, kailan pa darating sa beneficiary?

3893
04:58:45,130 --> 04:58:45,750
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Next year na.

3894
04:58:46,270 --> 04:58:56,730
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: What steps are we, will we take to fix this?

3895
04:58:56,870 --> 04:59:00,530
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Dahil, as I will go back, this is healthcare.

3896
04:59:02,010 --> 04:59:03,290
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: And it should be timely.

3897
04:59:06,620 --> 04:59:14,380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Madam Chair, moving forward nga po, we directed already to have an early procurement process po.

3898
04:59:14,380 --> 04:59:18,000
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kaya, for 2027, since the NEP is already approved,

3899
04:59:18,660 --> 04:59:19,820
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: pinapag-go ko na po.

3900
04:59:20,080 --> 04:59:21,720
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Para hindi na po mangyari ito.

3901
04:59:23,800 --> 04:59:26,740
Rep. Jesus "Bong" C. Suntay: Madam Chair, thank you very much for the time provided.

3902
04:59:27,040 --> 04:59:29,560
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Thank you very much, Representative Suntay.

3903
04:59:32,240 --> 04:59:37,660
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Representative Emano, we will go back to your 3 minutes 33 seconds time left.

3904
04:59:38,140 --> 04:59:44,080
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: If you will allow, since our Regional Director is not able to come to the room,

3905
04:59:44,080 --> 04:59:48,420
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: I think USEC Maestral would be able to answer your queries.

3906
04:59:48,880 --> 04:59:50,080
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: May we request USEC to...

3907
04:59:50,600 --> 04:59:51,360
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Yes, Madam Chair.

3908
04:59:51,460 --> 04:59:51,940
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Please reply.

3909
04:59:52,080 --> 04:59:57,080
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: So, maybe, Kong Bambi, you could restate your question so that we can answer properly.

3910
04:59:57,080 --> 04:59:59,900
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Madam Chair, di ba kanya yung oras 6.33 yung natira?

3911
05:00:00,530 --> 05:00:02,070
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: 6, 6.33 ba yun?

3912
05:00:02,150 --> 05:00:03,310
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: 3, 3.33 lang.

3913
05:00:03,610 --> 05:00:04,750
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: 5 minutes lang.

3914
05:00:04,950 --> 05:00:08,330
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Madam Chair, who chose the location for the hospital, Madam Chair?

3915
05:00:09,110 --> 05:00:11,130
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: Okay. Good afternoon po, Chair.

3916
05:00:11,770 --> 05:00:16,970
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: Sir, I'm sorry the regional director is indisposed right now.

3917
05:00:17,430 --> 05:00:20,430
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: But the engineer of the region is here.

3918
05:00:20,950 --> 05:00:22,330
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: I cannot hear, Madam Chair, please.

3919
05:00:22,670 --> 05:00:25,330
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: If she can speak closer to the...

3920
05:00:26,150 --> 05:00:26,970
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: Thank you.

3921
05:00:26,970 --> 05:00:33,490
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: Okay. Apparently, the land was donated by the local government during that time.

3922
05:00:34,130 --> 05:00:38,790
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: And then when it was passed, the project was executed by the DPWH.

3923
05:00:39,510 --> 05:00:41,830
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: Presently, it's 98% done.

3924
05:00:42,870 --> 05:00:46,970
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: However, due to 2025...

3925
05:00:47,890 --> 05:00:50,530
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: We'll get there, Madam Chair. We'll get there.

3926
05:00:50,930 --> 05:00:55,350
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: So who chose the specific location where the hospital will be placed, Madam Chair?

3927
05:00:56,550 --> 05:00:56,950
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: Um...

3928
05:00:56,970 --> 05:00:59,910
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: The land was donated po. So it was pre-chosen.

3929
05:01:00,670 --> 05:01:01,810
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: I would think so.

3930
05:01:01,990 --> 05:01:02,310
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: By?

3931
05:01:02,630 --> 05:01:03,990
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: By the local government.

3932
05:01:04,070 --> 05:01:05,050
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: By the local government.

3933
05:01:05,270 --> 05:01:08,030
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Okay. Let me continue, Madam Chair, if you will allow.

3934
05:01:09,030 --> 05:01:10,970
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: May I know the status of the hospital?

3935
05:01:11,250 --> 05:01:13,510
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: The status of the hospital now, Madam Chair?

3936
05:01:13,990 --> 05:01:15,710
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: Okay. It's 98% done.

3937
05:01:16,730 --> 05:01:17,790
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: 98% po.

3938
05:01:20,130 --> 05:01:20,770
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: 98?

3939
05:01:21,350 --> 05:01:21,950
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: 98%.

3940
05:01:21,950 --> 05:01:23,210
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Almost finished.

3941
05:01:23,210 --> 05:01:24,490
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: 98% of what, Madam Chair?

3942
05:01:26,760 --> 05:01:28,400
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: 98% of Phase 2.

3943
05:01:29,880 --> 05:01:33,720
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: And may we know, Madam Chair, how many phases will it be to be finished?

3944
05:01:34,060 --> 05:01:37,500
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Because 98% is actually too big, Madam Chair.

3945
05:01:39,640 --> 05:01:41,540
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: Okay. Um...

3946
05:01:41,540 --> 05:01:43,060
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: Apparently, it's four phases.

3947
05:01:43,540 --> 05:01:46,200
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: The second phase is almost done.

3948
05:01:50,480 --> 05:01:53,320
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: And may we know the design, Madam Chair?

3949
05:01:53,540 --> 05:01:55,380
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: How many floors will it be?

3950
05:02:03,340 --> 05:02:04,980
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: Originally, five stories.

3951
05:02:04,980 --> 05:02:10,980
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: It was adjusted to three stories due to issues with budget.

3952
05:02:11,880 --> 05:02:17,460
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Madam Chair, I don't think it's because of the issue of the budget.

3953
05:02:17,620 --> 05:02:21,480
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: May we know the real issue, why it could not be five stories, Madam Chair?

3954
05:02:21,480 --> 05:02:30,100
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: Okay. In 2025, it was discovered that it sits on a fault line, po.

3955
05:02:31,400 --> 05:02:33,080
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: And it sits on a fault line.

3956
05:02:34,360 --> 05:02:37,320
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: So, again, Madam Chair, let me go back to my first question.

3957
05:02:37,980 --> 05:02:42,360
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Who decided where the hospital will be placed, Madam Chair?

3958
05:02:45,000 --> 05:02:45,220
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: The LGU

3959
05:02:45,620 --> 05:02:47,920
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: po, when they donated the land.

3960
05:02:52,510 --> 05:03:04,610
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Madam Chair, may I know, what was the technical evaluation submitted by, for the record, DPWH, Madam Chair?

3961
05:03:12,210 --> 05:03:16,790
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: Okay. Initially, there was no report of a fault line in the area, sir.

3962
05:03:17,190 --> 05:03:20,450
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: And it was only discovered, I believe, in 2025.

3963
05:03:21,090 --> 05:03:26,090
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: But with regards to the report, we will need time to secure the report, po.

3964
05:03:26,850 --> 05:03:28,810
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Madam Chair, again, beg to disagree.

3965
05:03:29,170 --> 05:03:31,130
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Fault lines are from time immemorial.

3966
05:03:31,350 --> 05:03:35,090
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: It was not just discovered last 2025 that it existed, Madam Chair.

3967
05:03:40,400 --> 05:03:45,560
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: They discovered, daw po, na may, that it sits on a fault line in 2025 lang.

3968
05:03:45,880 --> 05:03:46,900
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: So, ongoing na po.

3969
05:03:46,920 --> 05:03:49,220
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Oh, no, Madam Chair. I cannot accept that answer.

3970
05:03:49,220 --> 05:03:55,040
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: It cannot, you know, fault line that does not just exist, Madam Chair, all of a sudden.

3971
05:03:55,840 --> 05:04:14,710
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: Okay. Initially, po, sa hazard map, it says it's...

3972
05:04:15,190 --> 05:04:17,630
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: more than 2 kilometers away.

3973
05:04:18,350 --> 05:04:24,030
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: And when the hazard map was updated, malapit na malapit.

3974
05:04:25,090 --> 05:04:27,490
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: I still don't agree, Madam Chair.

3975
05:04:27,610 --> 05:04:34,410
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Can I see the hazard map that they're talking about when was it established, given, Madam Chair?

3976
05:04:35,410 --> 05:04:39,950
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: We will submit na lang, po, because it's not with the technical team right now.

3977
05:04:41,250 --> 05:04:43,450
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Will it be submitted before plenary, Madam Chair?

3978
05:04:44,530 --> 05:04:44,930
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: Opo.

3979
05:04:52,890 --> 05:04:54,510
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: We will do it, Sir.

3980
05:04:56,820 --> 05:05:00,260
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Okay. That would be a very fine answer, Madam Chair.

3981
05:05:01,200 --> 05:05:02,580
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Next question, Madam Chair.

3982
05:05:04,900 --> 05:05:09,400
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: So, is it still possible to build a five-story building, Madam Chair, in a fault line?

3983
05:05:09,400 --> 05:05:11,880
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: A hospital in a fault line, Madam Chair?

3984
05:05:12,840 --> 05:05:16,000
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: Sir, they decided na three floors na lang.

3985
05:05:16,140 --> 05:05:17,400
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: And then, it needs to be...

3986
05:05:18,420 --> 05:05:28,210
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: It needs to be reinforced.

3987
05:05:28,410 --> 05:05:28,650
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: daw po

3988
05:05:29,530 --> 05:05:31,670
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: I think the word is retrofitted, Madam Chair.

3989
05:05:31,690 --> 05:05:32,030
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Yes, I'm sorry.

3990
05:05:32,390 --> 05:05:33,730
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: So, three stories.

3991
05:05:34,110 --> 05:05:40,490
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: And DOH can guarantee that once it is retropated, built a three-story building, Madam Chair,

3992
05:05:40,490 --> 05:05:43,210
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: it is now safe to use for public, Madam Chair.

3993
05:05:44,290 --> 05:05:48,470
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: That is the expertise of DPWH, po.

3994
05:05:50,130 --> 05:05:53,750
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: Yun po ang purview from the DPWH side.

3995
05:05:54,970 --> 05:05:57,270
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: I-retrofit lang daw po and okay naman.

3996
05:05:58,410 --> 05:05:59,530
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: According to them.

3997
05:06:00,010 --> 05:06:02,390
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: So, I'll take the word of DOH for it, Madam Chair.

3998
05:06:02,530 --> 05:06:04,610
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Pag munay nangyari doon, at least on record,

3999
05:06:06,150 --> 05:06:07,890
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: DOH allowed it to be built.

4000
05:06:09,210 --> 05:06:09,970
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: DPWH, po.

4001
05:06:10,770 --> 05:06:11,750
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: And DOH.

4002
05:06:21,710 --> 05:06:22,430
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Yes.

4003
05:06:23,690 --> 05:06:30,350
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Maybe we request the DOH Regional Director and USEC through Secretary

4004
05:06:30,350 --> 05:06:34,710
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: to submit the guidelines for...

4005
05:06:37,990 --> 05:06:43,710
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: to determine and how to assess this project.

4006
05:06:44,190 --> 05:06:47,490
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: So that moving forward, whether...

4007
05:06:47,490 --> 05:06:51,890
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: because when we do infrastructure projects,

4008
05:06:52,390 --> 05:06:54,410
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: it has to go through MGB,

4009
05:06:54,650 --> 05:06:56,990
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: it has to go through many evaluation,

4010
05:06:57,250 --> 05:06:59,950
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: especially infrastructure like this.

4011
05:07:00,330 --> 05:07:05,910
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: So, may we request DOH to review the process,

4012
05:07:05,910 --> 05:07:07,010
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: the procedures,

4013
05:07:07,010 --> 05:07:16,810
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: the procedures on determination of site up to the suitability of the site and submit to DS Bambi before the plenary budget.

4014
05:07:17,270 --> 05:07:18,110
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Is this okay, DS?

4015
05:07:19,310 --> 05:07:21,510
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Yeah, it would be very fine, Madam Chair.

4016
05:07:21,610 --> 05:07:29,230
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: For the record, Madam Chair, if ever DPWH allows them to build with all the other agencies allowing them to build,

4017
05:07:29,710 --> 05:07:31,630
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: may we know what the plan is now, Madam Chair?

4018
05:07:31,750 --> 05:07:34,830
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: A three-story level-what hospital, Madam Chair?

4019
05:07:38,040 --> 05:07:39,100
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: DOH, please repeat.

4020
05:07:39,180 --> 05:07:43,580
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: We will review first the report from the DP, Sir.

4021
05:07:44,100 --> 05:07:48,680
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: And then, we will give you a copy and our decision.

4022
05:07:49,420 --> 05:07:51,360
Undersecretary Mary Ann Palermo-Maestral: I will need to see it for myself as well.

4023
05:07:51,780 --> 05:07:54,180
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Madam Chair, I was given already a...

4024
05:07:54,180 --> 05:08:00,620
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: I was able to assist during the consultation and I was expecting already answers.

