06:14:19,710 --> 06:14:21,770
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: bayan, lalo na sa Central Luzon

5606
06:14:21,770 --> 06:14:23,110
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: na aming bayan

5607
06:14:23,110 --> 06:14:25,230
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: yung lalawigan ng bulakan po.

5608
06:14:26,250 --> 06:14:27,990
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Thank you, Madam Chair.

5609
06:14:29,190 --> 06:14:30,190
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Mr. Secretary?

5610
06:14:30,870 --> 06:14:31,630
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Madam Chair,

5611
06:14:31,790 --> 06:14:33,770
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: gaya po nung nabanggit, papaigtingin

5612
06:14:33,770 --> 06:14:34,970
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: po natin yung ating

5613
06:14:34,970 --> 06:14:37,790
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: supply chain system

5614
06:14:37,790 --> 06:14:39,970
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: kasama po dito

5615
06:14:39,970 --> 06:14:40,470
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: yung pag

5616
06:14:40,470 --> 06:14:43,290
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: may automation na po ngayon

5617
06:14:43,290 --> 06:14:45,490
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: although ang aking pong feedback

5618
06:14:45,490 --> 06:14:47,830
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: na nakukuha, hindi siya

5619
06:14:47,830 --> 06:14:49,470
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ganung karobast

5620
06:14:49,470 --> 06:14:51,790
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: o ano, na talaga

5621
06:14:51,790 --> 06:14:53,530
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: pong mamonitor natin

5622
06:14:53,530 --> 06:14:55,270
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: all the way down to the

5623
06:14:55,270 --> 06:14:57,030
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: CHD.

5624
06:14:57,610 --> 06:14:59,730
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Una po dyan nga, gaya na nabanggit

5625
06:14:59,730 --> 06:14:59,990
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: kanina.

5626
06:15:00,000 --> 06:15:11,180
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang mga 60% na po ng ating magamot ay doon na po sa region pinuprocure para po mabilis at hindi na po kailangan na galing dito sa central, magda-download pa.

5627
06:15:11,940 --> 06:15:23,980
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yung natitira pong 40% ay siya pong mga mamahaling gamot at medyo mahirap pong iprocure kasi ito na po yung mga bakuna, pang cancer drug, mental health na.

5628
06:15:23,980 --> 06:15:37,160
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kaya titingnan po natin yung talagang pangangailangan kasi minsan po nagkakaroon din po daw ng problema na hindi naman yun yung kailangan ng ating mga hospital at mga RHUs.

5629
06:15:37,660 --> 06:15:48,460
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So yun po ay pag-aaralan namin at ngayon nga po sa procurement, meron na pong requirement na bago po mag-reorder ay matingnan po yung stock level natin sa kabuan.

5630
06:15:48,980 --> 06:15:53,820
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Para po hindi natin mag-reorder tayo pero marami pa palang natitira.

5631
06:15:53,980 --> 06:16:01,640
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So ano po yun, efficiency, sistema, tsaka yung pag-o-automate po ng ating procurement system.

5632
06:16:02,960 --> 06:16:09,640
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Maraming salamat Madam Chair, sa sekretary, sa inyong tugon. Alam ko na magagawa po nyo ito.

5633
06:16:10,360 --> 06:16:19,460
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Isang tanong na lang po Madam Chair, gaano naman po ang kahandaan natin ng ating mga barangay health workers sa ganitong sitwasyon?

5634
06:16:19,460 --> 06:16:23,460
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Parapat lamang po ba na dapat ma-equip sila ng mga...

5635
06:16:23,980 --> 06:16:34,380
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: ganitong klaseng prophylaxis drugs upang mabawasan kung hindi man mapigilan ang pagkakaroon ng ganitong mga uri na sakit tuwing nagkakaroon po ng mga pagbaha.

5636
06:16:34,680 --> 06:16:35,540
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Thank you Madam Chair.

5637
06:16:36,460 --> 06:16:38,980
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So ito pong Madam Chair, doxycycline.

5638
06:16:40,000 --> 06:16:51,880
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Preemptively, nagbaba na po kami sa mga region at may bago po kaming polisiyang nilabas na kami na po mismo ang pupunta doon sa mga komunidad na nalubog.

5639
06:16:51,880 --> 06:16:57,560
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kaya may kasama po dapat kasing mga nurse o kaya doktor.

5640
06:16:57,960 --> 06:17:03,840
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasi hindi po pwedeng ibababa lang tapos self-administered kasi baka magkaroon po ng side effect.

5641
06:17:04,420 --> 06:17:06,900
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At saka yung dosaging po, iba't iba po yan.

5642
06:17:07,060 --> 06:17:12,280
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Depende po doon sa edad at saka doon po sa risk na dinaana ng ating pasyente.

5643
06:17:12,820 --> 06:17:16,980
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kung ito po ay moderate risk or severe risk, iba po ang dosaging.

5644
06:17:16,980 --> 06:17:21,520
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So yun po ay kasama dapat pong may prescription yung ating doktor.

5645
06:17:21,880 --> 06:17:28,100
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So yung barangay health worker po ang kaakibat na kasama natin para mga lugat ng mga barangay.

5646
06:17:28,320 --> 06:17:35,600
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Tapos kami na po ang talagang pupunta para po mag-distribute ng gamot para naaayon po doon sa dapat na dosaging.

5647
06:17:37,060 --> 06:17:40,780
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Maraming salamat, Sekretary, sa inyong mga response.

5648
06:17:41,620 --> 06:17:49,800
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Madam Chair, ito na lamang po at ako'y lubos na sumusuporta sa panukalang budget ng Department of Health.

5649
06:17:49,880 --> 06:17:50,540
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Thank you, Madam Chair.

5650
06:17:50,800 --> 06:17:51,240
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Thank you po.

5651
06:17:51,880 --> 06:17:56,000
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Maraming maraming salamat po, Representative Plato.

5652
06:17:56,520 --> 06:18:01,360
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Next on deck from the minority is Representative Elijah San Fernando.

5653
06:18:02,020 --> 06:18:03,600
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Maraming salamat po, Madam Chair.

5654
06:18:04,520 --> 06:18:05,780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sekretary, magandang hapon po.

5655
06:18:06,080 --> 06:18:13,100
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Unang tanong po ay bakit walang line item ang public health emergency benefits and allowances sa 2027?

5656
06:18:16,820 --> 06:18:21,600
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Karugtong nito ay ano na po ba yung status ng health emergency allowance?

5657
06:18:22,580 --> 06:18:39,940
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yung dili-discuss na. Yung number ko. Yung sa HIA. Magkano nga yung sabi natin. Okay.

5658
06:18:49,060 --> 06:18:55,510
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Actually nga po, nung ako po ay humingi ng presentation po dito sa ating budget,

5659
06:18:56,070 --> 06:19:00,530
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ay napansin ko rin po yun at sabi ko nga, magkano ba yung verifikado na?

5660
06:19:01,330 --> 06:19:06,070
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At ang nabanggit nga po ay 741 million.

5661
06:19:06,730 --> 06:19:10,630
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ito po yung verified na, although may mga iba pong nag-a-appel, pero sabi ko nga,

5662
06:19:11,130 --> 06:19:13,930
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: isama na natin doon sa ating pag-appel.

5663
06:19:13,930 --> 06:19:19,070
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Nag-a-appel na, nadagdagan ng 741 para nga po dito sa HAYA.

5664
06:19:19,450 --> 06:19:20,770
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Doon po sa verified na po.

5665
06:19:21,750 --> 06:19:32,410
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sa database po ng kalihim, ng DOH, ilan pa po ba yung mga unpaid HAYA arrears as of 2026?

5666
06:19:37,380 --> 06:19:45,940
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So ito po yung verified na 150,000 claims.

5667
06:19:45,940 --> 06:19:50,520
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pero yung mga iba pong apela, dahil meron na pong nilabas na,

5668
06:19:50,840 --> 06:19:58,480
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: parang administrative order ang dati nating kalihim na tapos na po yung deadline.

5669
06:19:59,140 --> 06:20:02,260
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So hindi na po nagpo-process ng mga karagdagang apela.

5670
06:20:02,440 --> 06:20:06,780
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ito na po yung na-set nung hanggang nag-deadline at ito po yung verified na.

5671
06:20:06,840 --> 06:20:10,180
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At ito po yung hinihingi naming karagdagan dito sa ating budget.

5672
06:20:10,720 --> 06:20:16,300
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So hindi na po nagpo-processo ng mga karagdagan pa ng mga apela, yung mga arrears?

5673
06:20:16,860 --> 06:20:17,560
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Tama po?

5674
06:20:20,310 --> 06:20:22,370
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Except po yung dadaan sa grievance.

5675
06:20:22,790 --> 06:20:25,530
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Apela at dadaan ng regions po.

5676
06:20:26,070 --> 06:20:32,290
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pero ito po ang verifikado, kaya ito po mas madali po nating i-apelang isama dun sa ating budget po.

5677
06:20:32,290 --> 06:20:33,330
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Mr. Secretary.

5678
06:20:33,550 --> 06:20:42,050
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Noong 2025, September, si then-Secretary, Amena Pangandaman, inaprubahan yung release ng 6.7 billion pesos

5679
06:20:42,050 --> 06:20:49,710
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: para daw po i-cover yung final payment for FEBA ng mga health and non-health workers.

5680
06:20:50,650 --> 06:20:52,690
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, ibig sabihin po ba?

5681
06:20:52,790 --> 06:20:59,530
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yan, dito po sa binabanggit ng DBM, wala nang unpaid hay arrears?

5682
06:20:59,930 --> 06:21:02,430
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kasama na rin po ba dito yung sa mga barangay health workers?

5683
06:21:07,900 --> 06:21:11,100
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Dun po sa 741 million po kasama po.

5684
06:21:12,220 --> 06:21:14,680
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kasama po yung sa mga BHWs.

5685
06:21:15,420 --> 06:21:15,920
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Okay po.

5686
06:21:16,920 --> 06:21:19,240
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Madam Chairperson, malaki pong problema dito.

5687
06:21:19,540 --> 06:21:24,420
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Dahil pa ulit-ulit po nating naririnig sa DBM at sa DOH,

5688
06:21:24,420 --> 06:21:31,080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: cleared at fully disbursed na ang mga huling bayarin para sa health emergency allowance.

5689
06:21:31,740 --> 06:21:34,180
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pero kausap ko po yung mga barangay health workers.

5690
06:21:34,840 --> 06:21:38,000
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sa 2026 BHW Haya Survey Report,

5691
06:21:38,840 --> 06:21:44,340
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: meron pa pong 5.15 billion pesos worth of unpaid arrears

5692
06:21:44,340 --> 06:21:53,020
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: affecting 47,000 barangay health workers across 294 cities and municipalities.

5693
06:21:53,420 --> 06:21:54,140
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ngayon po.

5694
06:21:54,140 --> 06:21:56,280
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ang tanong dito, Madam Chairperson,

5695
06:21:56,960 --> 06:21:58,200
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sekretary,

5696
06:21:58,960 --> 06:22:02,300
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ano po yung mga hakbang ngayon ng Department of Health

5697
06:22:02,300 --> 06:22:05,780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: tungkol dito sa usapin ng mga barangay health workers natin?

5698
06:22:05,900 --> 06:22:09,740
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: And there are pending bills dito po sa Kongreso

5699
06:22:09,740 --> 06:22:13,660
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: patungkol sa pag-address ng problema natin sa mga barangay health workers.

5700
06:22:14,040 --> 06:22:14,720
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Sekretary.

5701
06:22:20,880 --> 06:22:23,620
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So yun nga po yung mekanismong dinadaanan.

5702
06:22:23,760 --> 06:22:26,580
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: May grievance committee po per region na pwede pong dumulog

5703
06:22:26,580 --> 06:22:28,580
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: yung ating mga...

5704
06:22:29,580 --> 06:22:30,340
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: health care workers.

5705
06:22:30,500 --> 06:22:34,500
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At meron naman pong mga requirements na kailangan pong i-present

5706
06:22:34,500 --> 06:22:36,760
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: para po ma-validate yung kanilang claims.

5707
06:22:37,020 --> 06:22:38,680
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So nandun po sa grievance.

5708
06:22:39,260 --> 06:22:41,760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sa katotohanan lang po, yung mga grievance po natin,

5709
06:22:41,860 --> 06:22:43,640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: talagang ambabagal din kumilos eh.

5710
06:22:44,420 --> 06:22:47,480
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Lagi pong naibabalik, pabalik dun sa mga BHWs,

5711
06:22:47,540 --> 06:22:49,260
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: papunta po dun sa mga health care workers.

5712
06:22:49,760 --> 06:22:51,200
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Madam Chairperson, nag-time agad ako.

5713
06:22:53,420 --> 06:22:55,080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Dapat may extension ako, Madam Chair.

5714
06:22:55,980 --> 06:22:57,760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So ang binabanggit ko po dito,

5715
06:22:57,760 --> 06:22:59,540
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ang babagal nitong mga grievance,

5716
06:22:59,580 --> 06:23:02,440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: at hanggang ngayon actually, paulit-ulit yan,

5717
06:23:02,960 --> 06:23:05,820
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: binabato-bato yung mga health care workers natin,

5718
06:23:06,260 --> 06:23:07,960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: yung mga barangay health workers natin,

5719
06:23:08,040 --> 06:23:09,540
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: binabato-bato kung saan-saan.

5720
06:23:10,140 --> 06:23:12,000
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Just for the information of the good secretary,

5721
06:23:12,880 --> 06:23:15,440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: yung United Private Hospital Unions of the Philippines,

5722
06:23:15,560 --> 06:23:18,460
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: kasama po namin na nangalampag sa harap ng DOH mismo.

5723
06:23:18,960 --> 06:23:21,080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sabi ng DOH, eh wala sa amin problema.

5724
06:23:21,500 --> 06:23:22,840
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Problema nandun sa DBM.

5725
06:23:23,240 --> 06:23:25,280
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pinuntahan din namin yung DBM, sabi ng DBM,

5726
06:23:25,380 --> 06:23:28,120
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ah wala na, na-download na namin sa DOH,

5727
06:23:28,120 --> 06:23:29,140
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: nandun sa mga hospital.

5728
06:23:29,580 --> 06:23:32,720
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: O yung mga hospital, pati DOH, ganito rin po yung sinasabi.

5729
06:23:33,200 --> 06:23:35,960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So ano pong gagawin ngayon ng mga barangay health workers,

5730
06:23:36,080 --> 06:23:39,340
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: nung mga health workers natin, Mr. Secretary?

5731
06:23:43,260 --> 06:23:45,060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: I-idugtong ko na lang din po, Mr. Secretary.

5732
06:23:46,260 --> 06:23:49,620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kasi kung totoo na naibaba na yung pondo mula sa national,

5733
06:23:49,780 --> 06:23:51,780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: nasaan ngayon yung gaps?

5734
06:23:52,500 --> 06:23:53,380
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ano yung mga challenges?

5735
06:23:53,660 --> 06:23:56,500
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Nandoon ba sa mga centers for health development

5736
06:23:56,500 --> 06:23:59,020
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: o mga nasa LGU ang problema?

5737
06:24:03,590 --> 06:24:06,690
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So yun nga po, yung naibaba po ng DBM,

5738
06:24:06,710 --> 06:24:09,410
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ay naibabahagi na po natin.

5739
06:24:09,610 --> 06:24:13,210
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So ito po yung karagdagan doon po sa na-verify ka na.

5740
06:24:13,870 --> 06:24:16,850
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At out of that nga po, yung 5 billion,

5741
06:24:17,090 --> 06:24:20,730
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: kailangan po natin i-reconcile yan

5742
06:24:20,730 --> 06:24:23,470
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: kasi nga po ang malinis lang at na-verify namin

5743
06:24:23,470 --> 06:24:26,650
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ay yung 741 million.

5744
06:24:27,410 --> 06:24:28,710
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kaya po may proseso,

5745
06:24:29,630 --> 06:24:34,010
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: kasi hindi po din tayo makakadulog sa DBM

5746
06:24:34,010 --> 06:24:35,630
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: nang hindi po verifikado

5747
06:24:36,710 --> 06:24:39,310
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: at napakinig ko naman po kayo

5748
06:24:39,310 --> 06:24:41,530
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: na parang nagbabatuhan

5749
06:24:41,530 --> 06:24:45,290
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: ay titignan po natin kung paano po natin maayos yan.

5750
06:24:46,430 --> 06:24:47,850
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Iyan po, Mr. Secretary,

5751
06:24:48,190 --> 06:24:50,950
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: as much as I would like to accept your answer po,

5752
06:24:51,830 --> 06:24:54,230
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: yan na naman po kasi maririnig ng mga BHW

5753
06:24:54,230 --> 06:24:56,190
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: saka ng mga healthcare workers natin eh.

5754
06:24:56,810 --> 06:24:57,290
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Titignan.

5755
06:24:57,530 --> 06:25:00,010
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: We will take a look into the matter.

5756
06:25:00,510 --> 06:25:01,930
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Hindi po kasi katanggap-tanggap.

5757
06:25:02,530 --> 06:25:04,590
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Noong COVID-19 pandemic po,

5758
06:25:04,590 --> 06:25:06,490
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ang lalakas ng loob natin sabihin,

5759
06:25:06,710 --> 06:25:08,290
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ang mga bayani natin,

5760
06:25:08,410 --> 06:25:09,690
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: yung mga healthcare workers,

5761
06:25:10,710 --> 06:25:13,670
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: allied health professionals kasama na rin po doon.

5762
06:25:14,150 --> 06:25:15,730
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pero yung simpleng pagbibigay

5763
06:25:15,730 --> 06:25:17,870
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ng health emergency allowance,

5764
06:25:18,010 --> 06:25:19,790
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: hindi natin maibigay fully sa kanila.

5765
06:25:20,430 --> 06:25:21,590
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kayo po bilang DOH,

5766
06:25:21,710 --> 06:25:22,830
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: intindihin nyo naman po sana

5767
06:25:22,830 --> 06:25:25,430
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: kung bakit ganito na lang yung passion namin makapaningil

5768
06:25:25,430 --> 06:25:28,490
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: dahil kayo po yung ahensya na nakatoka

5769
06:25:28,490 --> 06:25:30,490
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: na mangunang ipaglaban

5770
06:25:30,490 --> 06:25:33,050
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: yung karapatan ng ating mga manggagawa

5771
06:25:33,050 --> 06:25:34,550
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: sa sektor pang kalusugan.

5772
06:25:34,550 --> 06:25:36,550
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So ano pong concrete commitment natin?

