Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yun lang medyo kailangan dagdagan siguro yung mga available share natin.

7817
07:57:07,380 --> 07:57:11,380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So, yung suicide surveillance po is very important.

7818
07:57:11,380 --> 07:57:13,380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pag may mga nakikita na po,

7819
07:57:13,380 --> 07:57:20,380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: yung kanilang mga peer na medyo meron pong mga actuation o nab-verbalize,

7820
07:57:20,380 --> 07:57:25,380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: yun po yung pinaka-signalis po na baka magtuloy.

7821
07:57:25,380 --> 07:57:32,380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kaya yun po yung ating setting-based impanelment ng mental health ay sa school-based nga po,

7822
07:57:32,380 --> 07:57:35,380
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: na i-align natin with YACAP.

7823
07:57:35,380 --> 07:57:43,540
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Thank you very much, Secretary. Thank you very much, Kong Tony.

7824
07:57:43,540 --> 07:57:46,540
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Just a reminder po sa ating lahat,

7825
07:57:47,540 --> 07:57:51,540
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: at 6 o'clock po, we will take a 15-minute health break.

7826
07:57:51,540 --> 07:57:54,540
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: So, we have 30 minutes more.

7827
07:57:54,540 --> 07:58:02,540
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: So, we request po our members to please make our questions concise,

7828
07:58:02,540 --> 07:58:06,540
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: and hopefully we don't repeat earlier questions already asked.

7829
07:58:06,540 --> 07:58:12,540
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Next on deck po is Representative Caroline Aguiao. Go ahead, ma'am.

7830
07:58:12,540 --> 07:58:16,540
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Thank you, Madam Chair. Good afternoon to DOH family.

7831
07:58:16,540 --> 07:58:29,540
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Good afternoon po. Madam Chair, katangungan ko lang po sa nutrition program ng ating DOH.

7832
07:58:29,540 --> 07:58:37,540
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Magkano po kaya yung continuing yung mga budget po natin for the stunting and wasting?

7833
07:58:37,540 --> 07:58:43,540
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then, ano po yung appropriate na-allocate for 2026?

7834
07:58:43,540 --> 07:58:49,540
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then, ano po yung how much is the budget for 2027?

7835
07:58:49,540 --> 07:59:00,540
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: So, sa atin po, can we give us the exact number of children currently stunted at saka wasted for 2025-2026?

7836
07:59:00,540 --> 07:59:10,540
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then, how much po ang binibigay natin ka-perahan sa each beneficiary for this program?

7837
07:59:10,540 --> 07:59:18,540
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: I know that the DOH, sinesentro po natin ang programa para sa mga children 0 to 59 months.

7838
07:59:18,540 --> 07:59:24,540
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And of course, for our nutrition program, we have also the pregnant women and then the lactated mothers.

7839
07:59:24,540 --> 07:59:28,540
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: So, ano po yung ginagawa po nating programa sa ngayon?

7840
07:59:28,540 --> 07:59:38,540
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And sapat ho ba ang pondo po natin for ano po yung natitira for 2026 and sa 2027?

7841
07:59:38,540 --> 07:59:45,540
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Na naka-allocate sa NEP po natin, okay na ba po ba yan? Salamat po.

7842
07:59:45,540 --> 07:59:57,640
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Thank you po. Madam Chair, ang ating prevalence of stunting noong 2025 ay 25.3%.

7843
07:59:57,640 --> 07:59:59,640
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ngayon po...

7844
08:00:00,000 --> 08:00:09,800
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: 2026 dahil ongoing pa rin po. Ang target po namin ay maibaba ng 20.8 pero hintayin pa po natin until end of year kung ano po yung accomplishment rate natin.

7845
08:00:10,300 --> 08:00:16,420
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At for 2027 po ay 19.4% po ang ating target na reduction ng stunting.

7846
08:00:16,420 --> 08:00:39,900
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang ating budget for nutrition in the 2025 ga is 976 million. Yung nga lang po bumaba tayo ng 2026 ng 223 million at ngayon din po 2027 ay may trend po ng pababa ng another 209 million.

7847
08:00:40,080 --> 08:00:45,900
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pero ang ating sinestrengthen ay yung first 1000 day program po together with DSW.

7848
08:00:46,420 --> 08:00:58,200
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: With PhilHealth. Kasi kasama na po dito yung dun pa lang sa prenatal na mamonitor na natin kasi nga po yung MCP natin kasama na yung 14, 14 nga ba?

7849
08:00:58,200 --> 08:01:14,520
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang prenatal. Yun pong 8 prenatal visits na kasama po yung monitoring ng growth rate po ng ating intrauterine yung ating bata.

7850
08:01:14,520 --> 08:01:15,520
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At pagkatapos.

7851
08:01:16,420 --> 08:01:25,320
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: At pagkatapos nga po ay after delivery which is still covered substantially by PhilHealth for postnatal for postpartum.

7852
08:01:26,120 --> 08:01:43,600
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: And maganda po yung mungkahi kanina ni Governor nung itahi din pati po yung family planning at saka lactation during the, bakit kasi yung for postnatal parang isang buwan at kalahati lang po eh parang maigse.

7853
08:01:43,600 --> 08:01:45,600
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So yun dun po ay kakabalik.

7854
08:01:46,420 --> 08:01:49,880
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Sabit natin yung monitoring ng first 1000 day.

7855
08:01:50,020 --> 08:01:53,840
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pati yung lactating mother pa paano po yung ating tulong na gagawin.

7856
08:01:54,420 --> 08:02:10,460
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So yun pong sa first 1000 day naman sa PhilHealth ay meron pong mga nutritional program na kasama yung RUTF at saka yung mga high protein diets na kinukover naman po ng ating PhilHealth program.

7857
08:02:13,480 --> 08:02:13,940
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Thank you.

7858
08:02:13,980 --> 08:02:15,040
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Thank you Madam Chair.

7859
08:02:15,040 --> 08:02:17,040
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Salamat.

7860
08:02:18,720 --> 08:02:32,500
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Regarding din po sa ating procurement sa human anti-rabies vaccines and the rabies immunoglobulin under the national rabies program natin, prevention and control program.

7861
08:02:33,300 --> 08:02:34,840
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Ano po yung ginagawa po natin?

7862
08:02:34,840 --> 08:02:39,760
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Is it the DOH procuring the vaccines?

7863
08:02:40,780 --> 08:02:43,660
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then magkano po yung inaalat po natin dito?

7864
08:02:43,780 --> 08:02:45,840
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then sufficient po ba ito?

7865
08:02:45,960 --> 08:02:47,840
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Kasi I think it's...

7866
08:02:48,720 --> 08:02:52,580
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: For the first dose, yun po yung libre.

7867
08:02:53,440 --> 08:03:11,240
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then yung succeeding doses na binibigay sa mga pasyente, yun po nasusubsidize or free din po yun na binibigay ng DOH or the LGU will be the one na procure the vaccines po.

7868
08:03:11,240 --> 08:03:19,910
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So meron po tayong 747 million na nakalaan po sa anti-rabies vaccine and immunoglobulin.

7869
08:03:20,390 --> 08:03:27,730
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Covered po natin dito yung Category 2 and Category 3 animal bite.

7870
08:03:28,330 --> 08:03:32,430
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yung pong full dose na vaccination is already covered.

7871
08:03:33,110 --> 08:03:33,270
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Diba?

7872
08:03:33,450 --> 08:03:34,850
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Hanggang ilan yan?

7873
08:03:34,950 --> 08:03:35,670
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Three doses?

7874
08:03:36,410 --> 08:03:40,110
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Hanggang three doses po, yun po yung completed dose.

7875
08:03:40,970 --> 08:03:42,390
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: But only...

7876
08:03:43,590 --> 08:03:49,390
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yung pong Category 2 at Category 3 na nababakunahan.

7877
08:03:50,390 --> 08:03:55,370
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yung po ay pumapatak lang po nung almost 30% of all projected animal bites.

7878
08:03:55,510 --> 08:03:58,830
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So meron pa rin po talagang hindi natin na kukover.

7879
08:03:59,450 --> 08:04:05,270
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Meron naman po tayong animal bite center ng PhilHealth na siya pong nagkukover.

7880
08:04:05,350 --> 08:04:05,790
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yun lang po.

7881
08:04:05,970 --> 08:04:08,970
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Ang covered ng PhilHealth ay only Category 3.

7882
08:04:09,750 --> 08:04:11,670
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Hindi pa po covered yung Category 2.

7883
08:04:11,890 --> 08:04:20,370
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pero ang public health intervention pong aming minumungkahi at mas tingin po namin mas cost effective ay bakunahan po yung ating pet.

7884
08:04:20,910 --> 08:04:30,150
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Na yun po ay dapat din ma-isama sa budget po ng Department of Agriculture at saka yung iba pong local government units.

7885
08:04:30,690 --> 08:04:35,310
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Kasi mas gagastos po tayo at tumataas po.

7886
08:04:35,450 --> 08:04:40,110
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Nasa top three utilization po ng PhilHealth ang animal bite.

7887
08:04:41,330 --> 08:04:44,250
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: May pag-uusap na pong i-cover yung Category 2.

7888
08:04:44,250 --> 08:04:50,250
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pero dahil nga po nagkulang yung ating budget, medyo hindi po namin maipag-uusap.

7889
08:04:50,390 --> 08:04:53,350
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: May roll out yung coverage ng Category 2 ng PhilHealth.

7890
08:04:54,010 --> 08:04:59,310
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So ang ano po namin talagang yung mga animal at saka yung pets po ang mabakunahan.

7891
08:05:00,190 --> 08:05:13,170
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: So Madam Chair, siguro doon sa DA para yung preventive measure, mas malaki kasi yung gasto sa gobyerno pag bumibili talaga tayo ng bakuna para sa mga, eto mga rabies sa mga ano natin, vaccines.

7892
08:05:13,170 --> 08:05:19,230
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: So siguro Madam Chair, doon sa DA, the vaccination of the pets.

7893
08:05:19,230 --> 08:05:25,270
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Tapos dapat yun po ang isang popundahan po natin aside from this program sa DOH.

7894
08:05:25,790 --> 08:05:28,470
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Thank you, Madam Chair.

7895
08:05:28,870 --> 08:05:47,290
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Regarding doon din po sa mga NIP natin, sa the National Immunization Program for the DOH, yung routine vaccines po natin, until now yung OPV, the Penta, and then the PCV, until now po hanggang ngayon is stuck out pa rin.

7896
08:05:47,610 --> 08:05:49,190
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: So it will really affect.

7897
08:05:49,230 --> 08:05:53,790
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: It will really affect yung fully immunized children po natin.

7898
08:05:54,690 --> 08:05:57,450
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Ano po yung gagawin as the new secretary po?

7899
08:05:57,550 --> 08:05:59,390
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Ano po yung gagawin po natin for this?

7900
08:05:59,390 --> 08:06:06,850
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: I know sabi nyo kanina may mga na-bead na po and then nag-go na-beading.

7901
08:06:08,010 --> 08:06:10,450
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Hanggang kailan po kayo itong shortage na to?

7902
08:06:10,610 --> 08:06:17,310
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then yun nga sabi ni Kong Green kanina na naglalakad na yung mababakunahan dapat.

7903
08:06:18,110 --> 08:06:18,290
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: So.

7904
08:06:19,230 --> 08:06:21,910
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Madam Chair, SEC, ano po yung kasagutan?

7905
08:06:24,370 --> 08:06:26,970
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Madam Chair, yung Penta-Valent na approved na po.

7906
08:06:27,170 --> 08:06:28,590
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: So ito gagalaw na po.

7907
08:06:29,410 --> 08:06:34,470
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Hopefully nga ma-deliver natin before end of the year, by October or November.

7908
08:06:35,390 --> 08:06:45,970
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yung MRC po, we are already doing the boosting of the missile ramps, missile mumps, yung tiglas hangin at tiglas.

7909
08:06:47,370 --> 08:06:50,850
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Yung gagawin nga po namin ay early procurement.

7910
08:06:50,990 --> 08:06:54,770
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: In anticipation nga po nung kailangan natin ng lead time.

7911
08:06:54,950 --> 08:07:08,350
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Pero at least yung 2026 na procured na po natin ngayong last week ko lang po na pirmahan para ma-deliver na nga by in 30 days to 45 days.

7912
08:07:09,030 --> 08:07:10,790
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Okay. Thank you, SEC. Madam Chair.

7913
08:07:11,190 --> 08:07:18,690
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Regarding po kasi sa mga vaccines po natin, di ba meron po tayong mga tinatanggap na mga donations na vaccines?

7914
08:07:18,690 --> 08:07:19,690
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Hindi ba over...

7915
08:07:20,990 --> 08:07:27,250
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Yung mga vaccine na pondo po natin na naka-allot for DOH, na-add po ba?

7916
08:07:27,390 --> 08:07:36,810
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Kasi di ba dito sa mga nagagaling sa mga CHD natin na mga mababakunahan na mga bata, nako-compute na po yun.

7917
08:07:37,190 --> 08:07:44,490
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: So monthly, sana continuous na po yung supply ng ating mga bakuna.

7918
08:07:44,490 --> 08:07:50,830
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then, yung next po ay yung mga NCD meds po.

7919
08:07:50,830 --> 08:07:58,570
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: So natin, Madam Chair, yung mga NCD kasi until now, na-stop na ho ba?

7920
08:07:58,770 --> 08:08:10,330
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Kasi ito yung malaking, malaki pong tulong sa ating mga LGUs, not only the LGUs, especially sa ating mga IPs, mga GIDA areas,

7921
08:08:10,330 --> 08:08:18,590
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: na kung saan yung mga pasyente, nanggagaling pa sa kabundukan sa mga islands, para lang pumunta, bumiliin ng mga NCD,

7922
08:08:18,710 --> 08:08:20,810
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: mga gamot nila.

7923
08:08:20,830 --> 08:08:23,870
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: For the hypertension, alam na nila.

7924
08:08:24,630 --> 08:08:33,030
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then, we all know that the isang mortality, mataas na mortality now, is for 2026, it's all the NCD cases.

7925
08:08:34,270 --> 08:08:44,370
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: So, pwede ho ba, Madam Chair, Secretary, na ibalik ho sana natin yung apat na gamot na pinupunduhan nyo before?

7926
08:08:44,830 --> 08:08:49,190
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Kasi ito po yung malaking tulong sa ating mga kababayan.

7927
08:08:49,190 --> 08:08:50,790
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Yung Amlodipine, Losexine.

7928
08:08:50,830 --> 08:08:54,470
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Zertan, Clopidogrel, Metformin.

7929
08:08:55,150 --> 08:08:58,670
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: At parang nakita ho namin is, nawala na po ito.

7930
08:08:59,330 --> 08:09:04,870
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Anyway, turapap po, para minsanan na lang po, Secretary.

7931
08:09:05,770 --> 08:09:17,470
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Doon sa mga DOH H-52 natin, kasi nakita na ho natin na may mga nalagyan ng pondo for 2027 sa NEP natin,

7932
08:09:17,470 --> 08:09:18,970
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: pero hindi po siya.

7933
08:09:19,310 --> 08:09:19,470
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Wala pong...

7934
08:09:20,830 --> 08:09:23,490
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Wala pong facility na gano'n doon sa lugar ko.

7935
08:09:24,230 --> 08:09:26,550
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Same din sa mga ibang lugar.

7936
08:09:27,230 --> 08:09:36,730
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then, also with siguro pinupunduhan ng isang politician, but then wala po doon sa lugar ho namin.

7937
08:09:37,330 --> 08:09:45,010
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then, doon sa equipments, if magpupundo po tayo ng mga facilities, mga structure, mga infra,

7938
08:09:45,010 --> 08:09:50,510
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: sana yung tapos na na-infra, yun ang bibigyan natin ng equipments.

7939
08:09:50,830 --> 08:09:59,890
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Equipments, equipping, hindi po natin pagsabayin yung infra at saka yung equipping.

7940
08:10:00,210 --> 08:10:07,930
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Kasi, eh di, nandatinga na lang yung equipments, masasayang din, masisira kung wala pa yung structure.

7941
08:10:08,750 --> 08:10:19,710
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Sana i-review po natin ulit, kasi sayang yung pera natin, pera ng gobyerno, kung gagawin po natin lagi yung gano'n.

7942
08:10:19,710 --> 08:10:20,710
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then, there are...

7943
08:10:20,830 --> 08:10:28,270
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: There are some facilities doon sa amin na walang, tapos na yung mga infra, pero wala naman silang equipments.

7944
08:10:28,890 --> 08:10:37,370
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then, sana po, kasi nanggaling po ako as a public health, nakita ko ho na yung mga pinupunduhan natin before,

7945
08:10:37,670 --> 08:10:43,170
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: yung mga BP up, yung mga weighing scale, kaya na po ng LGU na magpundo doon.

7946
08:10:43,170 --> 08:10:49,170
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Sana ang punduhan ng DOH ay yung mga malalaking equipments like the...

7947
08:10:50,830 --> 08:10:52,850
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Yung equipments na kailangan ho natin.

7948
08:10:54,310 --> 08:10:55,170
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then...

7949
08:10:55,170 --> 08:10:55,930
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Thank you for caring.

7950
08:10:55,930 --> 08:10:56,790
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Madam Chair, isa na lang.

7951
08:10:57,230 --> 08:11:00,230
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Sa amin, yung DOH na...

7952
08:11:00,230 --> 08:11:02,990
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Sa amin po, wala po kasing...

7953
08:11:02,990 --> 08:11:13,770
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Wala po kami yung DOH Managed Hospital sa Kalinga Provincial Hospital until now, nasa Senate na po, and hope matatapos na rin to.

7954
08:11:13,770 --> 08:11:19,190
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And sa mga FLR projects ho natin, na 2025-2026,

7955
08:11:20,830 --> 08:11:25,950
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: na FLR bago po yung napunduhan for the NEP on 2027 na Super RHU.

7956
08:11:26,170 --> 08:11:27,310
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Salamat po, Madam Chair.

7957
08:11:28,110 --> 08:11:30,650
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Salamat, Secretary and the DOH family.

7958
08:11:31,270 --> 08:11:33,970
Secretary Edwin M. Mercado: Madam Chair, well noted po. Maganda po mga suggestions.

7959
08:11:34,650 --> 08:11:35,850
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Thank you very much, Kong.

7960
08:11:36,230 --> 08:11:40,610
Rep. Maria Angela S. Garcia: Ang next po natin is Kong Edwin Cruzado. Go ahead po, Kong.

7961
08:11:40,610 --> 08:11:43,410
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Good evening to everyone.

7962
08:11:44,310 --> 08:11:49,150
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: To our chairman.

7963
08:11:50,830 --> 08:11:56,510
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Sa ating Secretary of Health and Dr. Mercado, Dr. Ho.

7964
08:11:57,710 --> 08:12:04,490
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Gusto kong pasalamatan ng PhilHealth kasi for the last two years, actually, you have already doubled the premium.

7965
08:12:05,610 --> 08:12:09,230
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: So maraming mga hospital na medyo nakaangat, nakabangon.

7966
08:12:10,250 --> 08:12:14,010
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: At saka yung mga doctors din, okay naman din ang natatanggap nila.

7967
08:12:14,910 --> 08:12:19,270
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: So thank you, Dr. Mercado. Ikaw yung ano, naging ano niyan.

7968
08:12:20,830 --> 08:12:23,910
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Sa magandang trabaho mo, good job, no?

7969
08:12:23,910 --> 08:12:30,330
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Sana ipagpatuloy ng ating Dr. Ho, na siyang president ngayon ng PhilHealth.

7970
08:12:31,590 --> 08:12:39,910
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Actually, with regards to financing, medyo okay naman ang financing natin sa PhilHealth.

7971
08:12:41,850 --> 08:12:45,070
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Yung utilization na lang ang dapat nating bantayan.

7972
08:12:45,850 --> 08:12:48,350
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: Saka ang challenge sa ating Secretary,

7973
08:12:48,350 --> 08:12:50,670
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: na sana wala nang,

7974
08:12:50,830 --> 08:12:54,270
Rep. Edwin Cruzado: masyadong expiring na gamot kasi

